                <h1>Aaron Grando</h1>
                <h2>I build things: prototypes, products, platforms.</h2>
                <p>
                    Hey, I'm Aaron. I turn AI ideas into useful products, build the platforms behind them, and lead the work that gets teams using them.
                    <br />
                    <br />
                    I've helped turn generative AI from scattered experiments into something an organization can actually use: a governed internal platform that gives agents the right context and gives people one place to use them, plus a process for testing ideas before investing in them. That work reached clients too. I've spent more than 15 years translating new technology into terms clients can understand and act on.
                    <br />
                    <br />
                    Today, I'm most at home where product strategy and platform architecture overlap: talking with people, figuring out what's worth building, and helping make it real.
                </p>
